{{Passive skill box|Wrath of the Cosmos}}

'''Wrath of the Cosmos''' is an [[atlas passive skill]] and [[Atlas keystone]].

==Mechanics==
[[Searing Exarch]] Eldritch Altars will have a chance to have two Upsides instead of one. If the Altar has two Upsides, its Downside is doubled.

==Location==
As of version 3.18.0 it is located at the left of the atlas passive skill tree, in the "Searing Exarch" wheel.
